      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is actually a big problem for Vket5, which is going to use SDK2 for most worlds:\nSDK2 avatars are permitted to use constraints, but SDK2 worlds are not. As avatars have more functionality than the world they will be displayed in, this creates a disparity when trying to demonstrate an avatar in a SDK2 world, as in the Virtual Market. Constraints would be needed in order to faithfully display avatars in a market setting.\nThere are already some Vket creators who are requesting access to SDK3 solely for the purpose of using constraints, but it would be infeasible for all creators to do so, as SDK2 is still the primary target for most Vket worlds.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
