      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "https://www.vrchat.com/home/download\n> VRCHAT SDK3 + Udon [Live Alpha]\n> Use this if you are creating new VRChat worlds, powered by Udon.\n> This SDK is in Live Alpha, and is not feature-complete. You cannot create avatars with VRChat SDK3 yet.\nSince it is not as if it is recommended to create a world with SDK3, I think that features that do not depend on Udon should be implemented in SDK2 also.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
